# The image only needs these files to bake R/Python packages at build time;
# the project itself is bind-mounted at run time. Keeps `docker build` from
# uploading _site, venvs, data, etc.
#
# A file under an excluded directory can't be re-included by naming it
# directly (Docker never walks into an excluded dir to find it) - so the
# directories themselves have to be un-ignored, with their unwanted contents
# re-excluded afterwards.
*
!requirements.txt
!renv.lock
!renv
renv/library
renv/.cache
!setup
setup/casaviz.zip.backup
setup/index.qmd
